      "Introduces concepts and methodologies used in archaeological field research. VRchaeology will focus on critical thinking and problem-solving skills through participation in virtual excavation, artifact recovery, analysis, and interpretation. VRchaeology will include weekly activities in virtual reality (VR) where students will use empirical evidence to uncover and reconstruct pieces of the past.",
